sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant HMI as DWIN HMI
  participant Parser as DWIN_HMI helper
  participant App as main.cpp
  User->>HMI: Touch configured button (UI project unavailable)
  HMI-->>Parser: UART frame beginning 5A A5
  Parser->>Parser: Require command byte 0x83; read button at index 8
  App->>Parser: getButton()
  App->>Parser: pageSwitch / setData / setQR
  Parser-->>HMI: 0x82 page or VP write
